  "an4.154:1.1": "bhikkhave balāni. ",
  "an4.154:1.2": "Katamāni balāni? ",
  "an4.154:1.3": "Satibalaṃ, samādhibalaṃ, anavajjabalaṃ, saṅgāhabalaṃ. ",
  "an4.154:1.4": "Imāni kho bhikkhave cattāri balānīti. 155. 2. ",
  "an4.154:1.5": "Cattār' imāni "
